---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Overview">
  <h1>Design Engineer</h1>
  <p>
    Token-driven component library built with React 19, SCSS Modules, and BEM
    naming. Every primitive pulls from shared CSS custom properties for
    consistent theming and dark mode support.
  </p>

  <h2>Principles</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Token-driven</strong> — all colors, spacing, typography from <code>tokens.scss</code></li>
    <li><strong>CSS Modules</strong> — scoped styles, no class collisions</li>
    <li><strong>BEM naming</strong> — <code>.block__element--modifier</code></li>
    <li><strong>React 19</strong> — no forwardRef, ref as standard prop</li>
    <li><strong>Dark mode</strong> — <code>.dark</code> class + <code>prefers-color-scheme</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Components</h2>
